msgid ""
"Confirm the PIN you use on this computer and choose a new master password. "
"Everything in the vault is encrypted again, and the PIN keeps working. "
"Backups made earlier still need the master password they were made with."
msgstr ""
"Potvrďte PIN tohto počítača a zvoľte nové hlavné heslo. Celý trezor sa znova "
"zašifruje a PIN bude naďalej fungovať. Staršie zálohy stále vyžadujú "
"vtedajšie hlavné heslo."

