"Encrypted vault uploaded as-is over HTTPS. Works with any RFC 4918 server."
msgstr ""
"Zašifrovaný trezor nahraný v pôvodnom stave cez HTTPS. Funguje s ľubovoľným "
"RFC 4918 serverom."

msgid "Encrypted vault uploaded as-is. Folder: \"AshyPass Backups\"."
msgstr ""
"Zašifrovaný trezor nahraný v pôvodnej podobe. Priečinok: \"AshyPass "
"Backups\"."

msgid "Encrypted zero (recommended — slow but secure)"
msgstr "Šifrovaná nula (odporúčané — pomalé, ale bezpečné)"

msgid ""
"Encrypting erases the whole drive. Unlock and lock work for LUKS drives."
msgstr ""
"Šifrovanie vymaže celú jednotku. Odomknutie a uzamknutie fungujú pre "
"jednotky LUKS."

