msgstr "Odhadovaná sila"

msgid ""
"Everything in the vault is encrypted again with the new password. Backups "
"made earlier still open with the password they were made with."
msgstr ""
"Všetko v trezore sa znova zašifruje novým heslom. Skôr vytvorené zálohy sa "
"naďalej otvárajú heslom, s ktorým boli vytvorené."

msgid "Everything is in sync"
msgstr "Všetko v súlade"

msgid ""
"Everything returns to how it was when the copy was made, including "
"attachments and password history. Entries created later disappear. The "
"current vault is kept in a file next to it."
msgstr ""
"Všetko sa vráti do stavu v čase vytvorenia kópie vrátane príloh a histórie "
"hesiel. Neskôr vytvorené prístupy zmiznú. Aktuálny trezor sa uloží do súboru "
"vedľa neho."

msgid "Everything was already in sync"
msgstr "Všetko už bolo synchronizované"

