msgid ""
"First export your passwords from the other app, then choose that file here. "
"Before importing you will see what was recognized. Delete unprotected export "
"files afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Najprv exportujte heslá z inej aplikácie a potom tu vyberte daný súbor. Pred "
"importom uvidíte, čo bolo rozpoznané. Nechránené exportné súbory potom "
"odstráňte."

